m/vi/LlniNYc9X-o/sddefault.jpg", "preference": -5, "id": "43"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/LlniNYc9X-o/sddefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEmCIAFEOAD8quKqQMa8AEB-AH-BIAC4AKKAgwIABABGHIgTihDMA8=&rs=AOn4CLANiOltBz-Nm31RHHOxEwK_qGn7-w", "height": 480, "width": 640, "preference": -5, "id": "44", "resolution": "640x480"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/LlniNYc9X-o/sddefault.webp", "preference": -4, "id": "45"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/LlniNYc9X-o/hq720.jpg", "preference": -3, "id": "46"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/LlniNYc9X-o/hq720.webp", "preference": -2, "id": "47"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/LlniNYc9X-o/maxresdefault.jpg", "preference": -1, "id": "48"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/LlniNYc9X-o/maxresdefault.webp", "preference": 0, "id": "49"}], "thumbnail": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/LlniNYc9X-o/sddefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEmCIAFEOAD8quKqQMa8AEB-AH-BIAC4AKKAgwIABABGHIgTihDMA8=&rs=AOn4CLANiOltBz-Nm31RHHOxEwK_qGn7-w", "description": "*NORTH EAST \n\n*UNDER “OPERATION ANKUSH” TEAM NORTH-EAST DISTRICT TIGHTENS, NOOSE ON AUTO LIFTERS, \n\n Five Notorious Auto Lifters, Including 03 Members of Interstate Gang Arrested.\n Fourteen Stolen Vehicles Along With Master Key’s And Allen Key’s Used in Auto Lifting Recovered.\n\n1. *WITH THE RECOVERY OF 10 STOLEN VEHICLES, JOINT TEAM OF SPL. STAFF AND AATS/ NED ARRESTED 03 MEMBERS OF INTERSTATE AUTO LIFTING GANG*. \n\nWorking on the inputs received from the different sources, a joint team of Spl. Staff and AATS North East District had been working immensely to crack the rising cases of auto lifting.\n\nOn 25.08.22, information regarding interstate members of auto lifting gang was received. The same was verified through reliable sources and trap was laid at different locations around “Baraha Khambha Red Light, Nand Nagri”. At around 09:30 PM, on the instance of informer, three suspected motorist, plying on two motorcycles, Hero Honda, Splender,  No. DL -8SAS-5257 and  Hero Honda Glamour, No. DL-5SAK-1405 was randomly stopped in the name checking the documents related to the ownership of the vehicles. They tried to mislead the police team but couldn’t produce any. On detailed checking, both the motorcycles found to be stolen. During cursory search, a bunch of master key’s and allen key’s were recovered from their possession. \n\nThey were apprehended and examined, on examination their identity was established as follows:-\n\n1.  Javed @junaid @Raja S/o Mansur Khan R/o Pilokhari Road, Meerut, UP,  Age- 40 years.\n2. Mohd. Haseen S/o Rahees  R/o Madhav Puram, Meerut UP, Age- 49 years.\n3. Shanu S/o Fonu R/o Wazirabad, Delhi, Age-21 years.\n\nDuring course of investigation they confessed for their involvements in various cases of Auto Lifting. On sustained interrogation, they revealed that they being interstate border area, they used to steal two wheelers from North East and its adjacent areas and kept  them parked at seclude places. Later, they take them to different parts in UP, mainly Meerut, and sale them for dirt cheap price. \n\nOn their instance, raids were conducted and 08 stolen two wheelers were recovered from different places. Action u/s 41 and 102 Cr.PC, had been initiated against them. \n\n*ARRESTED PERSONS*\n1. Javed @junaid @Raja S/o Mansur Khan R/o Pilokhari Road, Meerut, UP, Age- 40 years. He is illiterate and jobless usually involved petty criminal cases. Previous Involvements-03 (Theft) in UP.\n2. Mohd. Haseen S/o Rahees  R/o Madhav Puram, Meerut UP, Age- 49 years. He is illiterate and jobless usually involved petty criminal cases.\n3. Shanu S/o Fonu R/o Wazirabad, Delhi, Age-21 years. He is illiterate and works as a diver/life guard at Yamuna Ghat, Timarpur, Delhi. \n\n*RECOVERY*\n1. Scooty Honda Activa, No. DL-5SBP-37342.\n2. Scooter Hero No. DL-13SG-1350. \n3. Motor Cycle Livo No. UP-14CV-7739.\n4. Motor Cycle Suzuki Gixxer, No. UP-32LZ-7161.\n5. Motor Cycle Tvs Apache No. DL-5SAM-5262.  \n6. Motor Cycle Hero Passion No. DL-14SG-1358.\n7. Scooter Honda Activa, No. DL-5SBG-0328.  \n8. Hero Honda, Splender,  No. DL -8SAS-5257.\n9. Hero Honda Glamour, No. DL-5SAK-1405.  \n10. Motor Cycle, Bajaj Pulsur, No. DL 5SBV6077. \n\n*CASES WORKED OUT*\n1. e-FIR No. 021081/22 u/s 379 IPC, dated 28.07.22 PS Seemapuri, Delhi.\n2. e-FIR No. 020573/22 u/s  379 IPC, dated 24.07.22 PS Jyoti Nagar , Delhi.\n3. e-FIR no 020446/22 u/s 379 IPC, dated  22.07.22 PS- Anand Vihar, Delhi.\n4. e-FIR no 015931/22 U/S- 379 IPC, dated  09.06.22 PS Jamia Nagar , Delhi.\n5. e-FIR No. 015802/22 u/s 379 IPC, dated 08.06.22 PS Dayal Pur , Delhi.\n6. e-FIR No.014219/22 u/s 379 IPC, dated 24.05.22 PS Nand Nagari, Delhi.\n7. e-FIR No. 012187/22 u/s 379 IPC, dated 05.05.22 PS Jafrabad, Delhi.\n8. e -FIR No. 021038 /22 dated 28.07.22 u/s-379 IPC , PS Timarpur, Delhi.\n9. e -FIR No. 024108 /22 dated 25.08.22 u/s-379 IPC, PS  Bhajanpura, Delhi. \n10. e-FIR No. 021593/22 dated 01.08.22 u/s 379 IPC ,PS  Khajuri Khas, Delhi.\n\n \n\n2. *TEAM PS WELCOME, ARRESTED TWO AUTO LIFTERS AND RECOVERED FOUR STOLEN TWO WHEELERS*.\n\nOn 25.08.22, at about 08:00PM while patrolling at 65 Futa Road, Welcome, Delhi a Police team comprising SI Dharambir, HC Parmendar, HC Amit, HC Yogesh Bhati, Const. Udham and  Const. Vikas apprehended two person namely Faizu @ Sonu S/o Aasif  R/o Zafrabad, Age-23 years and Sarim @ Wasim S/o Md. Shubhan R/o Zafrabad, Age- 23 years on one Scooty No.DL- 5S BR-3440. On enquiry the same is found stolen vide e-FIR No. 022752/22 u/s 379 IPC, PS Welcome, Delhi.\n\nAccordingly, they were apprehended. During interrogation, they also disclosed their involvements in other cases of MV theft. On their instance, raid was conducted and  02 motorcycle and 01 Scooty were recovered from the area, near Eidgah, Welcome. Action u/s 41 and 102 Cr.PC, had been initiated against them. \n\n*ARRESTED PERSONS*\n1. Faizu @ Sonu S/o Aasif R/o Zafrabad,  Age-23 years. He studied up to  7th class and works in the field of jeans pants manufacturing.\n2. Sarim@Wasim S/o Md. Shubhan R/o Zafrabad, Age", "channel_id": "UCEta4qTrhS6DwcYD7quoUGg", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCEta4qTrhS6DwcYD7quoUGg", "duration": 20, "view_count": 11, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LlniNYc9X-o", "categories": ["People & Blogs"], "tags": [], "playable_in_embed": true, "live_status": "not_live", "media_type": "video", "_format_sort_fields": ["quality", "res", "fps", "hdr:12", "source", "vcodec", "channels", "acodec", "lang", "proto"], "automatic_captions": {}, "subtitles": {}, "comment_count": 0, "channel": "ISD CRIME  24×7", "channel_follower_count": 5140, "uploader": "ISD CRIME  24×7", "uploader_id": "@isdcrime2476", "uploader_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@isdcrime2476", "upload_date": "20220828", "timestamp": 1661653305, "availability": "public", "webpage_url_basename": "watch", "webpage_url_domain": "youtube.com", "extractor": "youtube", "extractor_key": "Youtube", "playlist_count": 286, "playlist": "ICICI Lombard bad after:2022-06-01 before:2022-12-01", "playlist_id": "ICICI Lombard bad after:2022-06-01 before:2022-12-01", "playlist_title": "ICICI Lombard bad after:2022-06-01 before:2022-12-01", "playlist_webpage_url": "ytsearch300:ICICI Lombard bad after:2022-06-01 before:2022-12-01", "n_entries": 286, "playlist_index": 187, "display_id": "LlniNYc9X-o", "fulltitle": "INTERSTATE GANG OF AUTOLIFTER BUSTED*.", "duration_string": "20", "is_live": false, "was_live": false, "epoch": 1780241782, "comments": [], "asr": 44100, "format_id": "18", "format_note": "360p", "source_preference": -1, "fps": 30, "audio_channels": 2, "height": 352, "quality": 6.0, "has_drm": false, "tbr": 667.502, "filesize_approx": 1644808, "width": 640, "language_preference": -1, "ext": "mp4", "vcodec": "avc1.42001E", "acodec": "mp4a.40.2", "dynamic_range": "SDR", "url": "https://rr2---sn-ci5gup-w5pz.googlevideo.com/videoplayback?expire=1780263381&ei=dVUcap_mFJOSz7sP-I-YmAc&ip=106.219.71.160&id=o-AJZ76jJoPlh3X5oOCdK7R_bUL5cxNB2dpApCW